      "name": "Aditi Jain",
      "platform": "Google",
      "rating": 5,
      "comment": "We recently completed a family trip to Leh-Ladakh organized by Wanderphilia, and it was an absolutely wonderful experience. The entire itinerary was thoughtfully planned and very well organized, making our journey smooth and stress-free.\n\nThe stays arranged throughout the trip were excellent, comfortable, and perfectly suited to our needs. Every detail, from transportation to accommodations, was managed seamlessly, allowing us to fully enjoy the breathtaking beauty of Ladakh.\n\nA special appreciation for the team's responsiveness and support throughout the trip. Their local expertise and attention to detail made a huge difference. We highly recommend Wanderphilia to anyone planning a Leh-Ladakh adventure and would gladly travel with them again in the future.",
      "createdAt": "2026-06-03T14:59:05.000Z",
      "profilePhotoUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJfCHbACnMVE21m3TDo8t8DOzSBFs6l8_-RxTjr0Q3OkqvAig=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
